WEBVTT

00:45.003 --> 00:46.296
Oh, things I hate?

00:47.756 --> 00:49.174
It's still Kook Yeon-su.

00:50.425 --> 00:52.886
I can give you about ten reasons
why I hate her.

00:53.470 --> 00:57.056
Firstly, as I'm sure you know,
she's so selfish.

00:57.140 --> 01:01.019
Yeon-su, can we see your notes
from our last class?

01:01.102 --> 01:03.146
I heard we'll be tested on that.

01:05.106 --> 01:06.941
You're the only one who took notes.

01:08.568 --> 01:10.612
The test is tomorrow.
Can't you help us out?

01:10.695 --> 01:12.781
We'll give it back right away.

01:23.958 --> 01:26.044
Sorry, I don't have my notes anymore.

01:26.127 --> 01:27.295
Can you go now?

01:28.213 --> 01:29.798
I knew she was stuck-up,

01:29.881 --> 01:33.426
but she's just unbelievable.

01:36.846 --> 01:40.016
I'm Kook Yeon-su, the leader
of Group 2 who will be presenting today.

01:40.099 --> 01:40.934
MAY 24, 2013
673 DAYS OF DATING

01:41.017 --> 01:42.143
My team…

01:43.436 --> 01:44.270
THE BROTHERS KARAMAZOV

01:44.354 --> 01:45.271
GROUP 2 KOOK YEON-SU

01:45.355 --> 01:46.272
…is just me.

01:47.273 --> 01:49.025
Let me start the presentation.

01:49.108 --> 01:52.862
I will be making a presentation
on Book 12, "A Judicial Error."

01:52.946 --> 01:54.614
And she doesn't have much…

01:54.697 --> 01:56.783
I mean, she has no social skills.

01:56.866 --> 02:00.870
FEBRUARY 20, 2012
215 DAYS OF DATING

02:03.456 --> 02:05.500
Let's get drunk today.

02:05.583 --> 02:07.377
I'll take you home, so don't worry.

02:07.460 --> 02:09.295
Why do you think you'll take me home?

02:10.296 --> 02:11.589
I can drink more than you.

02:11.673 --> 02:14.926
- You can't be sure of that.
- But since I'm a man…

02:15.009 --> 02:15.885
Let's see, then.

02:17.053 --> 02:19.055
- What?
- Let's see who wins.

02:19.639 --> 02:21.224
She tries to win at everything.

02:21.307 --> 02:22.725
You really mean it?

02:28.606 --> 02:30.692
Hey, we came here to have fun.

02:30.775 --> 02:32.110
- We don't have to do this.
- Drink.

02:36.865 --> 02:38.867
All right. You win, so let's stop.

02:41.744 --> 02:44.080
Her useless competitive spirit…

02:44.164 --> 02:46.624
You don't even act like a senior.

02:46.708 --> 02:48.001
How ridiculous.

02:48.084 --> 02:50.545
Is that all you have to show off?
Being my senior?

02:50.628 --> 02:52.547
What? I went easy on you, and--

02:52.630 --> 02:54.799
"Went easy on me"? When did you do that?

02:54.883 --> 02:56.634
Do you think you can push me around?

02:56.718 --> 02:57.969
- Do you?
- What did you say?

02:58.052 --> 02:59.804
I'm sorry, she's a bit worked up.

02:59.888 --> 03:01.556
Why would you apologize? Move.

03:01.639 --> 03:04.893
- Why don't you say that again?
- She picks fights with everyone.

03:04.976 --> 03:06.352
Move.

03:06.436 --> 03:09.314
And she's so stubborn.

03:10.440 --> 03:13.443
Have you lost your mind?
Why would I get a hairstyle like that?

03:13.526 --> 03:14.694
Why not?

03:14.777 --> 03:16.738
Do you really think that would suit me?

03:17.447 --> 03:20.033
- Why don't you look like this then?
- What?

03:20.116 --> 03:21.284
Do his hair like this.

03:23.244 --> 03:26.289
His hair is too short
to do this hairstyle, though.

03:26.372 --> 03:28.041
It's fine. Just do it.

03:28.124 --> 03:29.417
Hey, it's my hair, you know.

03:29.500 --> 03:32.337
The man of my dreams is someone
who can pull off this hairstyle.

03:32.420 --> 03:33.838
I'm not doing this.

03:33.922 --> 03:34.923
Please, carry on.

03:35.006 --> 03:36.007
FAITH HAIR SALON

03:39.636 --> 03:41.221
She's a self-centered person

03:41.304 --> 03:44.515
who has to do whatever she wants,
no matter what.

03:45.558 --> 03:47.268
Can't you take today off?

03:47.352 --> 03:50.730
No. It's not even
something that important.

03:50.813 --> 03:53.107
Today's the last day
to see the cherry blossoms.

03:54.442 --> 03:56.236
It's our last chance.
It's raining tomorrow.

03:56.319 --> 03:59.781
Why would we go all the way there
to see cherry blossoms?

04:00.448 --> 04:01.574
We can go next year.

04:02.242 --> 04:05.161
You said that last year.
So why not this year?

04:05.245 --> 04:07.956
And they're the prettiest
right before they start falling.

04:08.039 --> 04:10.208
Why would you want
to see flowers like that?

04:10.291 --> 04:12.710
They're just useless flowers
with bunched-up petals

04:12.794 --> 04:14.045
that have no scent.

04:16.673 --> 04:20.051
And she has no sense of romance at all.

04:21.052 --> 04:23.429
And… How many are left?

04:23.513 --> 04:25.807
- Hey, Yeon-su!
- Yes?

04:26.391 --> 04:29.394
- Hey, you said you'd eat lunch with me.
- Oh, right.

04:29.477 --> 04:32.146
Eat with your friend. I have to go
to the library to fix my assignment.

04:32.230 --> 04:33.314
What?

04:33.398 --> 04:37.277
I came to school to have lunch with you
when I didn't any classes today.

04:37.360 --> 04:39.028
Eat with him. This assignment's important.

04:39.112 --> 04:41.239
- Bye. I'll text you later.
- Hey.

04:41.322 --> 04:43.574
She always has important stuff to do.

04:44.367 --> 04:46.411
I hate that she only thinks about herself.

04:46.494 --> 04:49.163
She's your girlfriend? It's her?

04:49.247 --> 04:50.999
She's famous at our school.

04:51.082 --> 04:53.876
She's pretty, but her personality…

04:53.960 --> 04:56.212
Jeez. How can you date someone like her?

04:56.296 --> 04:58.965
Hey, do you even know
anything about Yeon-su?

04:59.048 --> 05:01.509
- What?
- Don't talk about her like that.

05:02.844 --> 05:04.095
You don't know anything.

05:05.638 --> 05:07.348
And another thing I hate…

05:08.558 --> 05:13.104
AUGUST 31, 2011
42 DAYS OF DATING

05:16.149 --> 05:17.608
This…

05:17.692 --> 05:20.486
And this. They'll be on the test,
so study this part.

05:20.570 --> 05:22.822
And read through this
at least three times.

05:22.905 --> 05:24.741
- Okay.
- I'm going to check.

05:27.660 --> 05:29.912
…is that only I know a side of Yeon-su,

05:31.622 --> 05:33.499
which nobody else knows.

05:33.583 --> 05:36.419
This is way more fun
than hanging out with Ung.

05:37.837 --> 05:40.590
Ung isn't really
fun to hang out with, right?

05:40.673 --> 05:41.966
- He's a snore.
- "Snore"?

05:42.050 --> 05:43.468
We call boring people "snores."

05:43.551 --> 05:44.761
Oh, really?

05:44.844 --> 05:46.763
Mom, I can hear everything.

05:46.846 --> 05:49.474
Mr. Snore has good ears, though.

05:49.557 --> 05:51.601
- Thank you, Mr. Snore.
- Right.

05:52.810 --> 05:55.063
Let's eat before we continue.

05:55.146 --> 05:58.608
FEBRUARY 20, 2012
215 DAYS OF DATING

05:58.691 --> 06:00.068
Get on my back.

06:09.202 --> 06:11.913
JUNE 4, 2012
320 DAYS OF DATING

06:15.291 --> 06:18.544
If you ever do that to Ung again,
I won't let it slide.

06:18.628 --> 06:21.172
Did you think I wouldn't notice you
bossing him around

06:21.255 --> 06:22.965
just because he's too nice?

06:23.549 --> 06:25.259
If you ever do that again,

06:25.343 --> 06:27.428
I'll show you how crazy I can really be.

06:29.263 --> 06:31.224
APRIL 1, 2013
621 DAYS OF DATING

06:37.188 --> 06:38.648
Why did you want to see me?

06:39.482 --> 06:41.067
- Are you upset?
- Me?

06:41.150 --> 06:43.611
Why? No. Why would I be?

06:44.904 --> 06:47.448
Why would you get upset over one meal?

06:47.532 --> 06:48.699
Well…

06:49.492 --> 06:52.912
- It's not exactly just one meal.
- Were you counting? You're so petty.

06:52.995 --> 06:55.456
Petty? Did you just call me petty?

06:57.333 --> 06:58.626
What? What is it?

07:12.807 --> 07:14.809
We saw the cherry blossoms.

07:17.145 --> 07:19.188
She showed this side of her only to me.

07:20.231 --> 07:22.191
So I couldn't help but love her.

07:26.696 --> 07:29.115
And the ninth reason…

07:30.992 --> 07:33.578
She makes me love her, but then…

07:35.830 --> 07:38.040
Why would we break up?

07:39.709 --> 07:42.044
When I think I can't be any happier…

07:43.004 --> 07:45.756
I'm always the first thing
you abandon when things get tough.

07:48.301 --> 07:50.636
…she takes me to the highest place…

07:51.304 --> 07:54.849
Am I the easiest thing you have
that you can throw away?

07:58.519 --> 07:59.604
No.

08:01.439 --> 08:03.191
…and she pushes me off the cliff…

08:04.400 --> 08:05.985
You're the only thing…

08:08.571 --> 08:09.739
I can throw away.

08:13.910 --> 08:15.578
…in the cruelest way possible.

09:07.672 --> 09:09.757
What if I was serious
and didn't act childish?

09:12.552 --> 09:14.136
Would you have managed?

09:20.643 --> 09:24.146
If you were sincere,
what would you have done?

09:42.498 --> 09:46.377
10 THINGS I HATE ABOUT YOU

09:46.460 --> 09:51.757
EPISODE 3

09:56.012 --> 09:57.179
IT'S BEEN 10 YEARS ALREADY
IT'S BLOWING UP AGAIN

09:57.263 --> 09:58.472
I'm a friend of Yeon-su.

09:58.556 --> 10:00.808
She does have a bad temper,

10:00.891 --> 10:01.976
but she's kind.

10:02.059 --> 10:05.313
Choi Ung's the one who usually
picks fights with people around him.

10:08.399 --> 10:10.776
What? Choi Ung's just a bit weird.

10:10.860 --> 10:13.779
He doesn't pick fights.
You're making it up.

10:16.532 --> 10:17.825
Do you even know him?

10:17.908 --> 10:20.536
"Just a bit weird"? He's very weird.

10:20.620 --> 10:22.747
You're the one who's making up things.

10:23.706 --> 10:24.915
You're ridiculous.

10:24.999 --> 10:27.251
You'd be shocked
if you knew how he's doing now.

10:27.335 --> 10:29.128
He's really successful.

10:29.211 --> 10:31.005
He's a famous artist. Jeez.

10:32.048 --> 10:33.924
Ung, did you get some sleep?

10:34.008 --> 10:35.343
Are there mosquitos around?

10:37.178 --> 10:38.596
What's he doing, then?

10:38.679 --> 10:41.766
I'm sure he won't be as successful
as our smart Yeon-su.

10:42.350 --> 10:43.309
My gosh.

10:44.560 --> 10:46.354
He was only pretending to be dull.

10:46.437 --> 10:49.482
He's earning loads of money,
and he's a successful…

10:50.608 --> 10:52.234
What are you doing?

10:55.529 --> 10:57.615
Does he have the intelligence
of a mosquito?

10:59.825 --> 11:00.785
So…

11:01.285 --> 11:03.621
Eun-ho, how is my schedule?

11:04.705 --> 11:07.333
Nothing much besides
preparing for your exhibit. Why?

11:07.416 --> 11:09.669
- Really?
- Are you going to do the live drawing?

11:11.545 --> 11:14.840
Get me some more work.
I've rested for too long.

11:14.924 --> 11:17.843
All of a sudden? You said
you wanted to take things slow.

11:17.927 --> 11:19.428
I need to get my mind off things.

11:20.471 --> 11:21.972
- What?
- Don't tell me

11:22.056 --> 11:24.642
you're going to be
cooped up in your room working again.

11:24.725 --> 11:28.229
No, I won't do that.
But get me a lot of work.

11:28.312 --> 11:30.815
And I'll think about the live drawing.

11:31.774 --> 11:32.775
All right.

11:33.442 --> 11:35.569
But Ung, you have to get plenty of sleep.

11:36.153 --> 11:38.322
Your insomnia seems to have gotten worse.

11:42.493 --> 11:44.370
I guess it's still summer.

11:47.081 --> 11:49.166
YOU'D BE SHOCKED IF YOU KNEW
HOW HE'S DOING NOW

11:50.835 --> 11:53.671
COMMENTS

11:56.048 --> 11:57.508
- What are you looking at?
- What?

11:58.467 --> 11:59.552
Nothing.

12:03.431 --> 12:05.724
- Hey, Sol-i…
- Yes?

12:07.476 --> 12:09.103
Never mind. Forget it.

12:12.606 --> 12:15.901
You know,
there are two ways to drive people crazy.

12:15.985 --> 12:18.529
The first is to stop
in the middle of a sentence, and--

12:18.612 --> 12:20.197
I met Ung a while ago.

12:22.199 --> 12:24.910
I mean, I went to see him.

12:26.954 --> 12:29.623
You? Why? What for?

12:30.791 --> 12:32.668
- Do you still--
- No!

12:33.252 --> 12:34.879
There was someone

12:35.421 --> 12:38.841
I had to meet for a project,
and it turned out to be him.

12:39.425 --> 12:40.426
Isn't that funny?

12:41.969 --> 12:46.265
Goodness. What's he doing?

12:46.348 --> 12:48.225
Is he successful?

12:48.309 --> 12:52.021
I don't know what he did,
but he seemed successful.

12:54.398 --> 12:56.901
The same boy who used to
always lie in the shade?

12:58.027 --> 13:00.446
Life is full of surprises, isn't it?

13:03.532 --> 13:05.826
So, how was it?

13:06.869 --> 13:08.787
- What do you mean?
- You know.

13:08.871 --> 13:10.789
How was it seeing him again?

13:11.540 --> 13:12.750
I didn't feel anything.

13:13.667 --> 13:14.960
Hey.

13:15.044 --> 13:16.629
You're obviously lying.

13:16.712 --> 13:21.550
Even I feel weird when someone
so much as says the name of my ex.

13:21.634 --> 13:23.135
There's no way you felt nothing.

13:23.219 --> 13:25.763
Don't you have too many exes
to be saying that, though?

13:25.846 --> 13:29.350
Shut up. Being way too cool
about that isn't normal.

13:29.433 --> 13:31.352
I really am cool about it.

13:31.435 --> 13:33.687
You know I don't hold grudges.

13:41.779 --> 13:42.780
Hello?

13:45.074 --> 13:46.158
Kim Ji-ung?

13:48.369 --> 13:50.120
Do what?

13:57.586 --> 13:58.796
That again?

13:58.879 --> 14:01.465
Go-oh was putting on an act
in front of me.

14:01.549 --> 14:04.176
Kook Yeon-su! You are crazy!

14:04.260 --> 14:06.512
He's cute, but he looks like a fool.

14:06.595 --> 14:09.598
Right? So how can I resist him?

14:09.682 --> 14:11.475
COMMENTS
NJGODDESS

14:11.559 --> 14:13.644
Nice username.

14:13.727 --> 14:15.563
But why did he film something like that?

14:15.646 --> 14:18.607
I don't know. He's full of surprises.

14:19.191 --> 14:20.442
He keeps me entertained.

14:21.569 --> 14:22.444
Where is Chi-seong?

14:22.528 --> 14:24.780
The CEO wanted to see him.

14:24.864 --> 14:26.740
Why? For what?

14:29.535 --> 14:31.370
What is it? Just tell me.

14:32.121 --> 14:34.748
I think it's because of your
live show yesterday.

14:35.833 --> 14:37.001
What about it?

14:37.084 --> 14:38.627
It seemed people gossiped

14:38.711 --> 14:42.923
that you seem to be suffering
from depression and look medicated.

14:43.924 --> 14:45.301
There were articles about it.

14:45.384 --> 14:48.596
If our CEO summons you or Chi-seong,
just tell me.

14:48.679 --> 14:49.638
I'll go instead.

14:50.681 --> 14:51.765
Okay.

14:54.143 --> 14:55.561
Just turn it off.

14:55.644 --> 14:56.604
All right.

14:59.982 --> 15:02.276
- But who is it?
- "Mr. Choi Ung"?

15:05.112 --> 15:05.946
He called me.

15:06.030 --> 15:07.656
Let's get back to filming!

15:07.740 --> 15:09.742
Could I have five, I mean, ten minutes?

15:12.077 --> 15:13.078
MR. CHOI UNG

15:16.582 --> 15:18.125
MR. CHOI UNG

15:19.293 --> 15:23.130
I answered a bit late
since I was busy with my shoot.

15:23.213 --> 15:24.757
What's the occasion?

15:25.758 --> 15:26.759
Hello?

15:28.594 --> 15:29.720
Mr. Choi?

15:34.725 --> 15:36.518
MR. CHOI UNG

15:42.441 --> 15:45.569
- Hello?
- Why did you hang up so quickly?

15:45.653 --> 15:48.906
- It was the first time you called me.
- Oh, did I?

15:48.989 --> 15:50.950
Yes, you did.

15:52.076 --> 15:53.577
Why did you call me?

15:53.661 --> 15:56.413
Well, that thing you asked for last time.

15:56.497 --> 15:58.332
- Drawing your buildings…
- You'll do it?

15:58.415 --> 15:59.667
Yes, about that…

15:59.750 --> 16:01.961
Since I've always drawn
whatever I wanted to,

16:02.044 --> 16:04.630
I've never been commissioned
to draw something before.

16:04.713 --> 16:07.633
I think I'll be able to decide
after seeing your buildings.

16:07.716 --> 16:10.636
Sure. Why don't we go see them right now?

16:11.720 --> 16:14.056
I think I'll be busy today.

16:14.682 --> 16:16.350
But aren't you busy as well?

16:16.433 --> 16:18.143
- I am, but I'm not.
- What?

16:18.227 --> 16:21.689
I'm busy but I'm not,
so tell me when you're free.

16:21.772 --> 16:24.817
Well, then I'll get back to you
after checking my schedule.

16:25.484 --> 16:28.112
Shouldn't I be the one saying that?
I'm the celebrity here.

16:28.195 --> 16:29.905
This feels kind of wrong.

16:29.989 --> 16:33.200
NJ! The director says
we have to start filming.

16:34.034 --> 16:36.996
Anyway, get back to me later.
And it'd better be soon.

16:37.079 --> 16:40.457
I hate it when people say
they'll contact me and take a long time.

16:40.541 --> 16:41.500
Bye, then.

16:42.084 --> 16:43.043
Alright.

16:44.044 --> 16:45.504
My gosh!

16:45.587 --> 16:47.673
You told me to get you more work.

16:47.756 --> 16:50.467
But you called NJ yourself
when I'm your manager!

16:50.551 --> 16:54.263
Gosh. Are you upset about that?

16:54.346 --> 16:56.306
What? Seriously?

16:56.890 --> 16:58.767
You're unbelievable!

16:58.851 --> 17:00.936
You've really changed, Ung.

17:01.020 --> 17:03.230
Do you think you're a big shot artist

17:03.313 --> 17:06.275
because you're contacting NJ in person?

17:06.358 --> 17:09.445
You're going to get a lot of hate.

17:09.528 --> 17:11.280
From me, and from NJ's fans.

17:11.363 --> 17:14.324
The whole country's going to hate you.

17:14.408 --> 17:15.868
Shut up.

17:16.869 --> 17:18.162
I have a job for you.

17:19.329 --> 17:22.458
What? Are you going to meet NJ now?
Should I get the car ready?

17:25.377 --> 17:27.212
I'm your manager,

17:27.838 --> 17:29.965
not your slave.

17:30.049 --> 17:32.134
Do I really have to do this?

17:32.217 --> 17:35.179
If you have a conscience,
you'd better earn your keep.

17:35.262 --> 17:38.015
You spent days
sleeping and eating at my house.

17:38.098 --> 17:41.310
Seriously? Don't be so petty.
It was only a few days and--

17:41.393 --> 17:45.105
Hey. You totally emptied my fridge.

17:45.189 --> 17:46.648
You're like a locust.

17:46.732 --> 17:49.359
All the food in my house disappears
whenever you come by.

17:49.443 --> 17:51.236
Should I file a claim for all that?

17:51.320 --> 17:53.405
I'll take care things here.
You can go rest up.

17:53.489 --> 17:56.075
Pull out all the weeds
and spread the cement.

17:56.158 --> 17:58.160
- Get a professional for that!
- Hey.

17:59.203 --> 18:01.080
The whiskey on my shelf disappeared too.

18:01.163 --> 18:03.791
I'm actually quite skilled at cementing.

18:03.874 --> 18:05.000
Where should I do it?

18:05.959 --> 18:07.044
Hey, Ji-ung.

18:14.301 --> 18:15.219
What?

18:15.719 --> 18:16.887
Let's film.

18:18.138 --> 18:20.307
- What?
- You have to do it.

18:21.725 --> 18:24.061
Jeez. Stop annoying me.

18:25.062 --> 18:28.232
I have to do it.
So you're going to do it too.

18:28.315 --> 18:30.192
What are you on about?

18:30.692 --> 18:33.403
- Did Dad tell you to film me?
- No, it's not that.

18:34.488 --> 18:35.447
You and Yeon-su.

18:37.366 --> 18:39.368
Let's film another documentary.

18:50.254 --> 18:52.047
- No way.
- Why?

18:52.631 --> 18:55.259
Are you mad? Do you really think
I'd film that with her?

18:55.342 --> 18:58.095
He's right. Those two filming
another documentary together?

18:58.178 --> 19:00.931
It'll only take about a month,
and I'll be filming it myself.

19:01.014 --> 19:03.267
Why are you suddenly
trying to film that again?

19:04.560 --> 19:08.522
Listen. As you know,
those videos are blowing up again.

19:08.605 --> 19:11.692
And we're thinking of filming
a special youth documentary.

19:11.775 --> 19:12.818
You're perfect for it.

19:12.901 --> 19:15.946
And most of all, those videos are fun.
It's great material.

19:16.029 --> 19:17.781
Right, they are pretty fun.

19:17.865 --> 19:21.201
Hey. You know how I broke up with her.

19:21.285 --> 19:22.828
How can you ask me to do that?

19:22.911 --> 19:24.413
It's been a long time.

19:24.496 --> 19:26.248
- Do you still have feelings for her?
- Gosh.

19:26.331 --> 19:29.126
As if. I don't have any feelings left.

19:29.793 --> 19:32.921
- I don't want to see her again.
- That means you still have feelings.

19:34.339 --> 19:35.674
Anyway, I'm not doing it.

19:37.759 --> 19:42.097
To be honest,
I think it's going to be pretty fun

19:42.181 --> 19:44.141
because of your relationship.

19:44.224 --> 19:45.976
Watch the videos again.

19:46.059 --> 19:49.396
There are so many comments,
and you two are very popular.

19:49.479 --> 19:51.732
Are you a sociopath?
Are you trying to use me?

19:51.815 --> 19:54.276
And I'm pretty sure she's going to say no.

19:54.359 --> 19:55.903
I already talked to her.

19:57.571 --> 19:58.655
What did she say?

20:01.700 --> 20:02.701
What did she say?

20:02.784 --> 20:05.537
She started swearing at me,
so I've backed off for now.

20:07.539 --> 20:09.625
I can't believe we agree on something.

20:09.708 --> 20:11.835
Anyway, I'm not doing it.

20:13.128 --> 20:14.922
That's just total nonsense.

20:20.177 --> 20:23.096
You're going to have
a really hard time convincing him.

20:23.180 --> 20:24.723
He got an amazing offer,

20:24.806 --> 20:27.684
but he's hesitating because
Yeon-su's involved.

20:27.768 --> 20:28.977
Is that so?

20:29.061 --> 20:31.480
Then they can work together
and film together too.

20:31.563 --> 20:33.273
But what if they do that

20:33.857 --> 20:36.360
and Ung starts getting feelings
for her again?

20:40.572 --> 20:44.117
He suddenly asked me
to get him a lot of work,

20:44.201 --> 20:45.494
so I'm getting worried.

20:47.204 --> 20:50.916
Maybe he has a lot on his mind
because he saw her again.

20:52.084 --> 20:54.836
Gosh. I never want to see him
go back to his old habits.

20:54.920 --> 20:56.296
You saw it too.

20:56.922 --> 20:58.006
It was crazy.

20:59.049 --> 21:00.550
Can you endure that again?

21:01.551 --> 21:02.761
Don't you remember?

21:06.014 --> 21:08.892
He was totally crazy
the first few months after they broke up.

21:08.976 --> 21:11.103
5 YEARS AGO
JUNE 20, 2016

21:11.186 --> 21:12.521
Jeez.

21:12.604 --> 21:15.357
Let's go home, Ung! Get a grip!

21:16.817 --> 21:17.901
Eun-ho.

21:19.236 --> 21:21.571
Do you know what Yeon-su hates the most?

21:22.239 --> 21:23.240
What?

21:24.658 --> 21:25.867
Getting drunk

21:27.411 --> 21:29.579
and making a scene late at night.

21:30.080 --> 21:31.415
My gosh.

21:32.666 --> 21:34.668
Jeez. He's driving me crazy.

21:34.751 --> 21:35.961
Ung, it's late!

21:36.044 --> 21:38.297
Hey, where are you going! Darn it!

21:39.798 --> 21:42.259
He did everything that Yeon-su hated…

21:42.342 --> 21:45.304
JUNE 22, 2016

21:48.307 --> 21:51.018
What is it this time? What are you doing?

21:51.101 --> 21:52.853
Another thing she really hates.

21:52.936 --> 21:55.147
Buying things out of impulse while drunk.

21:55.230 --> 21:58.108
Why would she nag me
when I'm buying stuff with my money?

21:58.191 --> 22:00.694
…and ran about like a mad dog
that broke free from its leash.

22:00.777 --> 22:03.155
JUNE 23, 2016

22:09.369 --> 22:10.912
Ung, wake up.

22:12.664 --> 22:14.624
- No.
- You have an exam today.

22:14.708 --> 22:16.626
- Get up.
- And another thing…

22:17.252 --> 22:18.754
What did you say?

22:19.338 --> 22:21.131
Not going to school

22:21.715 --> 22:23.675
the day after you drink.

22:24.259 --> 22:25.552
What?

22:25.635 --> 22:27.763
It's one of the things that Yeon-su hates.

22:29.431 --> 22:32.517
He acted like he gave up on life.

22:37.230 --> 22:40.901
AUGUST 3, 2016

22:45.572 --> 22:48.116
Weren't you the one
who told him about stocks?

22:48.200 --> 22:51.661
I've read online that stocks can
help you get over a breakup.

22:51.745 --> 22:53.705
Stocks during the day
and exercise at night.

22:53.789 --> 22:55.540
That leaves you no time
to mope about your ex.

22:56.458 --> 22:59.169
I guess it was quite effective.

23:03.215 --> 23:04.841
He was busy doing part-time jobs

23:04.925 --> 23:07.427
making up for all the money he lost.

23:08.220 --> 23:10.972
Ready, go!

23:11.056 --> 23:13.308
One, two! One, two!

23:14.267 --> 23:16.311
Two, two! Two, two!

23:16.394 --> 23:18.980
Thanks to me,
he got a lot of exercise then

23:19.064 --> 23:20.941
and was able to keep himself healthy.

23:21.441 --> 23:24.194
SEPTEMBER 29, 2016

23:35.497 --> 23:36.790
But, for some reason…

23:39.000 --> 23:40.335
despite keeping himself busy,

23:41.044 --> 23:42.712
he still seemed miserable.

23:44.422 --> 23:46.716
After he kept doing that on and off again…

23:46.800 --> 23:47.843
Mother.

23:47.926 --> 23:50.262
That's when it started.

23:50.345 --> 23:51.513
Hasn't he come out yet?

23:55.475 --> 23:57.519
Choi Ung. This is enough. Open the door.

23:57.602 --> 24:00.147
I'm counting to three,
then I'm just breaking in.

24:00.230 --> 24:03.191
One, two, three!

24:23.170 --> 24:27.048
And to put Ung and Yeon-su together again…

24:28.508 --> 24:29.968
Wouldn't that be disastrous?

24:45.317 --> 24:47.694
Early birds just get tired earlier.

24:49.654 --> 24:50.947
Hurry up.

24:51.031 --> 24:53.366
COMMENTS

24:53.450 --> 24:55.035
Jeez.

24:55.118 --> 24:56.369
HE'S LIKE A SQUID

24:56.453 --> 24:57.746
UNG IS SO CUTE

25:00.457 --> 25:01.791
What did I tell you?

25:02.459 --> 25:04.461
It's nice seeing such compliments, right?

25:06.630 --> 25:08.924
Stop pretending to be asleep.
I already saw you.

25:15.889 --> 25:18.308
Anyway, give it some thought.

25:19.017 --> 25:22.103
Once you see all the videos,
you might change your mind.

25:22.771 --> 25:23.772
I did, too.

25:26.399 --> 25:27.359
And…

25:30.820 --> 25:32.155
Never mind.

25:37.285 --> 25:38.620
Well…

25:39.454 --> 25:42.958
Yeon-su did seem to hate the idea
more than you.

25:46.211 --> 25:47.462
I'm just saying.

26:13.238 --> 26:14.906
TRENDING AGAIN
SCHOOL LIFE PLAYBOOK

26:27.627 --> 26:29.004
TRENDING AGAIN
SCHOOL LIFE PLAYBOOK

26:45.645 --> 26:48.940
SBC SPECIAL DOCUMENTARY
SCHOOL LIFE PLAYBOOK

26:49.024 --> 26:51.526
Choi Ung skipped class and ran away again.

26:52.110 --> 26:54.446
It's his life his ruining.

26:54.529 --> 26:56.114
- I was so young.
- What can I do?

26:56.948 --> 26:58.825
My skin used to be so elastic.

26:58.908 --> 27:00.243
Hurry up.

27:06.875 --> 27:09.669
Kook Yeon-su really exhausts people.

27:10.587 --> 27:13.048
Why does she live such an exhausting life?

27:13.590 --> 27:16.217
Early birds just get tired earlier.

27:17.469 --> 27:20.138
That's why I'm living
such an exhausting life.

27:23.099 --> 27:25.894
What is he going to be when he grows up?

27:25.977 --> 27:27.896
We can sleep all we want when we're dead.

27:28.480 --> 27:31.900
I'm sure he's going to be lazy
his whole life.

27:33.276 --> 27:36.196
He became a famous artist, Yeon-su.

27:38.239 --> 27:40.116
Life really is unfair.

28:10.605 --> 28:12.899
What?

28:12.982 --> 28:15.110
IT'S BEEN TEN YEARS ALREADY
I WONDER WHAT THEY'RE UP TO

28:15.193 --> 28:18.363
THIS IS WHAT BEING YOUNG IS ALL ABOUT

28:18.446 --> 28:21.199
THEY'RE SO YOUNG AND INNOCENT
LIKE SUMMER

28:21.282 --> 28:23.034
I thought you were a ghost!

28:27.414 --> 28:30.750
- "This is what being young is all about."
- "This is what being young is all about."

28:31.251 --> 28:33.837
- "They're so young and innocent
- "They're so young and innocent

28:33.920 --> 28:36.506
- like summer."
- like summer."

28:44.597 --> 28:45.682
Sorry.

28:48.560 --> 28:50.311
Hey! I'm sorry!

28:50.895 --> 28:51.896
I said I'm sorry!

28:52.397 --> 28:53.398
Sorry!

28:54.107 --> 28:55.108
Hey.

29:00.739 --> 29:02.657
Don't run! Stop running!

29:06.035 --> 29:07.662
Hey!

29:08.621 --> 29:11.124
Kook Yeon-su! You are crazy!

29:21.092 --> 29:24.095
Darn it.
Why did Ji-ung have to bring it up again?

29:31.478 --> 29:34.022
I won't ever see him again, anyway.

29:41.780 --> 29:44.657
ARTIST NU-A

29:44.741 --> 29:46.743
But the problem is this.

30:11.226 --> 30:12.811
I never ran into him

30:12.894 --> 30:15.438
during the past five years
since we broke up.

30:43.383 --> 30:44.551
But, all of a sudden,

30:45.134 --> 30:48.221
we keep running into each other
to the point of being weird.

31:08.366 --> 31:10.243
Wait. My crutch!

31:11.202 --> 31:12.161
Just a minute, sir.

31:18.918 --> 31:20.920
That brat.

31:21.004 --> 31:22.964
It get that it can happen once or twice.

31:28.428 --> 31:29.470
Excuse me.

31:32.682 --> 31:34.267
But how is this even possible?

31:45.612 --> 31:47.196
Why is this happening?

32:02.337 --> 32:04.380
Why is this happening to me?

32:10.053 --> 32:11.429
The paper bags here are so…

32:18.478 --> 32:20.772
Are you following me around?

32:20.855 --> 32:22.398
That's ridiculous.

32:22.482 --> 32:24.233
Then why are you in my neighborhood?

32:24.317 --> 32:26.444
I live around here, you know.

32:26.527 --> 32:28.029
You moved!

32:28.112 --> 32:30.865
So? Do you even know where I live now?

32:34.285 --> 32:36.037
Hey. Does this even make sense?

32:36.120 --> 32:38.915
We never ran into each other
for the past five years.

32:38.998 --> 32:40.833
If it bothers you, go somewhere else.

32:41.834 --> 32:44.504
What? No. I'm not bothered.

32:44.587 --> 32:45.797
You're the one who's bothered.

32:45.880 --> 32:48.341
He's still as childish as ever.

32:48.424 --> 32:50.468
Me? No, why would I be?

32:50.551 --> 32:52.971
You mean nothing to me.

32:53.554 --> 32:57.016
How is she so skilled at being annoying?

32:57.100 --> 32:58.226
Gosh.

32:58.309 --> 33:02.021
You're lingering around me
because of that project, right?

33:02.105 --> 33:03.898
You're hoping I'll change my mind.

33:03.982 --> 33:07.068
Oh, that? You don't need
to worry about it anymore.

33:07.151 --> 33:09.821
We're getting another artist
to work on that project.

33:09.904 --> 33:10.863
What? Who?

33:10.947 --> 33:13.533
This artist named Nu-a
who's pretty popular these days--

33:14.534 --> 33:17.245
Hey, Nu-a's just a total knockoff.

33:17.328 --> 33:19.789
Nu-a's always just copying my style.

33:19.872 --> 33:24.377
Well, it's up to the public
to decide who's copying who.

33:24.877 --> 33:27.213
I think Nu-a's art
is much better than yours.

33:27.964 --> 33:30.258
Hey, don't cross the line.

33:30.341 --> 33:32.301
Where are you going? I'm not done here.

33:32.385 --> 33:35.513
You seemed to be bothered by me,
so I'm avoiding you.

33:36.222 --> 33:37.056
I'm not.

33:37.140 --> 33:40.101
And you really shouldn't work
with Nu-a. You'll regret it later.

33:40.184 --> 33:42.729
Find a different artist to work with.

33:43.604 --> 33:45.565
Just listen to me. Hey!

33:46.190 --> 33:48.401
Gosh. My bad.

33:48.484 --> 33:50.695
It went all the way over there. Go get it.

33:51.612 --> 33:54.407
- Hey, Yeon-su!
- I can be childish too.

33:54.490 --> 33:56.242
I should've done this earlier.

33:56.325 --> 33:57.493
I feel great.

34:00.121 --> 34:02.623
- What?
- It was supposed to be Go-oh.

34:02.707 --> 34:06.419
He wants to cancel the contract
if we're working with Nu-a instead.

34:08.546 --> 34:12.133
You said you found Go-oh.
Why are you suddenly changing the artist?

34:12.216 --> 34:15.803
Well, Nu-a is also
a popular artist these days.

34:15.887 --> 34:17.889
It will be great with Soen Shop.

34:17.972 --> 34:20.141
And Nu-a's been very enthusiastic.

34:20.224 --> 34:23.478
I know, but he said he only wants Go-oh.

34:23.561 --> 34:26.064
Why? Did he ask for too much money?

34:26.731 --> 34:28.649
Well…

34:28.733 --> 34:31.652
Yeon-su. It was going well.
What's going on?

34:32.278 --> 34:34.989
You know how important
this project is for our company.

34:35.073 --> 34:36.866
Everyone's counting on you.

34:40.620 --> 34:44.123
I don't care. If he wants more money,

34:44.207 --> 34:45.917
write up a new estimate.

34:46.000 --> 34:47.919
I'll try to make it work.

35:11.526 --> 35:13.986
Why is everything a mess?

35:20.118 --> 35:23.579
All of this began after Choi Ung appeared.

35:29.544 --> 35:30.586
Bye, sir.

35:30.670 --> 35:32.547
Right. Get out of here.

35:36.300 --> 35:37.593
Chae-ran.

35:37.677 --> 35:41.347
Where is this jerk?
I haven't seen him all day.

35:41.430 --> 35:44.016
He's trying to cast
the people for the documentary.

35:45.393 --> 35:47.895
So, has he gotten them on board?

35:48.813 --> 35:50.982
He never reports his progress to me.

35:51.482 --> 35:53.943
He never fails
when he sets his mind on something.

35:54.026 --> 35:56.904
Right. That's why I can't
scold him for anything.

35:57.905 --> 35:58.990
He's so annoying.

36:00.199 --> 36:03.452
Why did he suddenly
decide to do the documentary though?

36:03.536 --> 36:06.205
He spent a few days
watching through the old videos.

36:06.289 --> 36:08.249
I guess it piqued his interest.

36:09.500 --> 36:10.626
All of them?

36:15.298 --> 36:16.507
You know,

36:17.049 --> 36:21.137
I did such a good job.
There are so many fun episodes.

36:21.929 --> 36:26.017
So he watched everything.
That's kind of adorable.

36:26.100 --> 36:28.227
Come to think of it,

36:28.311 --> 36:30.855
Ji-ung was pretty cute
when he was in high school.

36:30.938 --> 36:32.940
When he appeared on the screen,

36:33.649 --> 36:35.234
he would freeze.

36:37.445 --> 36:41.407
By the way, why do you always
ask me about Ji-ung?

36:41.490 --> 36:42.992
What do you mean?

36:43.659 --> 36:46.495
Everyone keeps asking me
about Ji-ung, not just you.

36:46.579 --> 36:48.789
Well…

36:51.167 --> 36:54.503
- Because you know him best.
- What?

36:54.587 --> 36:57.465
Everyone asks you first
when they're looking for Ji-ung.

36:57.548 --> 36:59.383
Didn't you notice?

37:01.469 --> 37:03.387
- Why?
- It's obvious.

37:22.990 --> 37:25.409
Should I tell you
what Ji-ung was like in high school?

37:26.535 --> 37:29.580
- Well, if you're not interested…
- You can tell me if you're bored.

37:36.754 --> 37:38.214
Looking at Ji-ung…

37:41.425 --> 37:44.512
always reminds me of my high school days.

37:44.595 --> 37:47.265
So I have to tell you
about my high school days first.

37:47.348 --> 37:50.434
Why did Ms. Kook suddenly
get off work so early?

37:50.518 --> 37:53.354
She probably went
to talk to Go-oh about our project.

37:53.437 --> 37:55.481
Thanks to her,
we got to get off work early.

37:55.564 --> 37:57.024
So how about some drinks?

37:57.108 --> 37:59.402
I'm on a diet.

38:00.736 --> 38:01.737
No way.

38:03.239 --> 38:05.783
Hey, isn't that Ms. Kook?

38:06.575 --> 38:07.868
Goodness!

38:09.704 --> 38:11.706
Did she get off early to go on a date?

38:13.040 --> 38:15.167
They look so good together.

38:15.251 --> 38:17.169
I can't believe this!

38:17.253 --> 38:20.589
Wait, there's no way.

38:20.673 --> 38:21.841
Why do you say that?

38:22.633 --> 38:26.637
To be honest, I was shipping her
with someone else.

38:26.721 --> 38:30.308
What do you mean? Is she going somewhere?

38:30.391 --> 38:32.518
That's not what I mean.

38:33.352 --> 38:37.857
I meant that I thought
she would end up dating Mr. Jang.

38:37.940 --> 38:39.525
What? Ms. Kook and Mr. Jang?

38:39.608 --> 38:41.027
What do you mean?

38:41.736 --> 38:44.780
I have a sixth sense
when it comes to stuff like this.

38:44.864 --> 38:48.409
Something's going on
between Ms. Kook and Mr. Jang.

38:48.492 --> 38:50.286
I can smell it.

38:50.369 --> 38:52.079
And they do look good together.

38:52.163 --> 38:54.957
I don't think so.
They're always at each other's throats.

38:55.041 --> 38:57.209
That's how romance usually begins.

38:57.293 --> 38:59.378
- You haven't got a clue.
- I actually do.

38:59.462 --> 39:02.757
You're wrong anyway
since that guy came into the picture.

39:02.840 --> 39:06.927
We can't know for sure yet.
I have to keep watching them.

39:07.011 --> 39:09.180
Then how about discussing that

39:09.263 --> 39:12.016
over some thin pork belly?

39:12.099 --> 39:14.852
Didn't you hear me?
I'm on a diet right now.

39:14.935 --> 39:18.147
Didn't you hear me?
I said, thin pork belly.

39:20.691 --> 39:22.485
Well, I guess thin slices are okay.

39:22.568 --> 39:24.362
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

39:28.657 --> 39:30.743
I think you're just wasting your time.

39:30.826 --> 39:32.161
I told you I won't do it.

39:32.244 --> 39:33.746
Still, I want a reason.

39:33.829 --> 39:35.081
Don't you know already?

39:35.164 --> 39:37.124
It's Choi Ung.
Why would I do that with him?

39:37.208 --> 39:40.461
Why not? There's nothing between you two.

39:41.045 --> 39:43.172
Don't tell me
you still have feelings for him.

39:43.714 --> 39:45.466
Did you come here just to annoy me?

39:45.549 --> 39:48.427
Being childish won't work on me.
Go try your luck with Ung.

39:50.513 --> 39:53.766
- I knew it wouldn't work.
- Then why did you come here?

39:53.849 --> 39:55.851
It's still my job to get you on board.

39:56.602 --> 39:58.062
If this doesn't work,

39:59.063 --> 40:00.856
I'll have to do this by the book.

40:00.940 --> 40:02.525
Fine. Let's see you try.

40:02.608 --> 40:05.653
I'm sure I won't change my mind,
but I'll hear what you have to say.

40:10.116 --> 40:14.745
Why do you think people decide
to star in a documentary?

40:16.914 --> 40:18.499
Well…

40:19.333 --> 40:21.001
To promote their businesses, or…

40:21.085 --> 40:24.130
I'm sure most of them don't have
businesses to promote.

40:25.381 --> 40:29.343
For the pay. You get paid for them.
That's why I did it back then.

40:29.427 --> 40:31.262
Then you know it's not a huge sum.

40:31.345 --> 40:33.722
Are you telling me to come up
with a reason?

40:33.806 --> 40:35.599
I'm always honest when I'm casting.

40:35.683 --> 40:40.146
"There's only one thing
we can give to you."

40:41.564 --> 40:44.900
"We're recording
a part of your life for you."

40:47.319 --> 40:48.362
You're right.

40:48.446 --> 40:52.450
Most people seem to think
that it's not a big deal.

40:52.533 --> 40:53.742
But…

40:54.827 --> 40:58.414
when we finish shooting,
and they see the completed work,

40:58.497 --> 41:00.624
they realize then what I meant.

41:02.251 --> 41:03.461
They realize

41:03.544 --> 41:07.673
how precious it is to be able to
capture and store a moment in their lives.

41:09.467 --> 41:12.219
That's why it's actually easier for me

41:12.303 --> 41:14.638
to convince you than other people.

41:16.807 --> 41:18.726
You've had those records before.

41:20.769 --> 41:22.646
Then you'll know the best.

41:22.730 --> 41:25.274
You have a memory
of your summer from when you were 19.

41:25.357 --> 41:28.277
Be honest with me.
Does that really mean nothing to you?

41:32.740 --> 41:33.866
Well…

41:34.700 --> 41:35.951
Did you even watch them?

41:38.037 --> 41:41.373
- No.
- You and Ung are the same.

41:42.124 --> 41:44.919
Why do you both try so hard
to avoid seeing those videos?

41:45.753 --> 41:47.213
To be honest,

41:47.880 --> 41:50.007
I first thought that this was meaningless.

41:50.090 --> 41:52.510
But when I looked through the videos,

41:52.593 --> 41:57.264
I realized that you two are perfect
for our documentary on youth.

42:01.227 --> 42:02.937
You're good with words, Ji-ung.

42:04.230 --> 42:05.314
I give you that.

42:06.065 --> 42:09.193
But you've failed to convince me.
Sorry, but I still won't do it.

42:16.116 --> 42:17.034
Fine.

42:18.619 --> 42:19.620
What?

42:22.081 --> 42:23.207
Is that it?

42:24.208 --> 42:25.960
I've never failed at casting people.

42:27.545 --> 42:29.380
That means I have another plan.

42:31.632 --> 42:33.133
That doesn't sound good.

42:34.301 --> 42:37.846
Will you tell me
if I ask you what you're going to do?

42:41.517 --> 42:42.601
About Ung…

42:47.314 --> 42:48.732
I can't let her work with Nu-a.

42:48.816 --> 42:51.360
See? You should have thanked her
and accepted her offer

42:51.443 --> 42:53.487
when she wanted to work with you.

42:53.571 --> 42:54.947
You idiot.

42:55.030 --> 42:56.365
Over my dead body.

42:56.448 --> 42:59.535
As an adult, you should know how to keep
your personal life separate from work.

43:00.119 --> 43:03.289
Everyone's nagging me about that
as if they're any better.

43:03.372 --> 43:06.625
Jeez, you're such a loser. Unbelievable.

43:07.543 --> 43:08.502
Ung, be honest.

43:08.586 --> 43:11.630
You want Yeon-su to come
and beg you to work with her, right?

43:11.714 --> 43:14.675
You're doing this
because you want her to beg you,

43:14.758 --> 43:16.552
even if it's because of work.

43:18.387 --> 43:20.723
- She'll never do that.
- That's what I mean!

43:20.806 --> 43:23.267
You know that, so why are you doing this?

43:23.350 --> 43:26.103
You seem to be the one
picking fights with her.

43:26.604 --> 43:28.105
It's so annoying.

43:28.188 --> 43:30.941
She pretends she doesn't care
and acts indifferent.

43:31.025 --> 43:32.568
No. Why would I be?

43:32.651 --> 43:35.029
You mean nothing to me.

43:35.112 --> 43:36.822
She's always like that.

43:36.905 --> 43:39.408
Oh, that? You don't need
to worry about it anymore.

43:39.491 --> 43:40.534
We're getting another artist.

43:40.618 --> 43:42.745
This artist named Nu-a
who's pretty popular…

43:42.828 --> 43:45.497
She's so selfish
and always so full of herself.

43:45.581 --> 43:46.832
Well, she won again.

43:47.958 --> 43:51.003
Just go and say
that you'll do that project.

43:51.086 --> 43:54.214
If you agree to do it,
they'll choose you over Nu-a.

43:54.298 --> 43:57.009
Hey, why would I ever do
something that benefits her?

43:57.718 --> 43:59.970
I should be doing stuff that she hates.

44:01.847 --> 44:03.265
Darn it.

44:08.812 --> 44:10.356
I just had an idea.

44:21.492 --> 44:24.161
What's with that look?
I have a bad feeling about this.

44:25.579 --> 44:26.789
Right.

44:26.872 --> 44:29.750
I should be doing the stuff she hates.

44:29.833 --> 44:32.753
A great way to win against Yeon-su.

44:34.421 --> 44:36.924
I don't know what you're thinking,
but I want to stop you.

44:37.007 --> 44:38.050
Hey, Eun-ho.

44:39.093 --> 44:40.886
I have some work for you to do.

44:40.969 --> 44:42.721
What? I cemented your backyard!

44:42.805 --> 44:45.265
No, I mean work as my manager.

44:45.933 --> 44:47.976
Your manager? Is it about NJ?

44:49.061 --> 44:52.106
Does this involve NJ?
Can I look forward to it this time?

45:00.572 --> 45:02.908
Why didn't I think of this before?

45:27.516 --> 45:30.352
He's a total player. I'm sure of it.

45:35.357 --> 45:39.486
Why do men say
they'll call you but never do so?

45:40.070 --> 45:43.449
He said he'll call me,
so I can't bring myself to call him first.

45:43.532 --> 45:47.411
But he hasn't called for days.
Why is he acting like this?

45:47.494 --> 45:49.413
He said he was my fan…

45:53.250 --> 45:55.085
He said he liked me when we first met.

45:55.169 --> 45:57.629
So why isn't he contacting me? Why?

46:01.216 --> 46:05.095
You know why. He's not into you.
He's not interested.

46:05.179 --> 46:06.513
He's keeping you on the hook.

46:06.597 --> 46:09.391
He could just be cautious.

46:09.475 --> 46:10.851
Right.

46:28.869 --> 46:34.917
CHOI UNG

46:41.507 --> 46:43.091
My name is Gu Eun-ho.

46:45.177 --> 46:47.179
GU EUN-HO

46:59.316 --> 47:00.484
STAY HEALTHY

47:06.532 --> 47:07.824
WENT DRINKING WITH UNG

47:07.908 --> 47:09.034
I can't believe this.

47:09.117 --> 47:12.079
He's drinking and having fun,
but why isn't he calling?

47:15.958 --> 47:19.086
No, I can't like a photo of someone
who isn't a celebrity.

47:46.071 --> 47:49.658
All right, I get it.

47:50.409 --> 47:52.578
Yes, I'm totally fine.

47:53.495 --> 47:55.080
I'm almost home!

47:55.664 --> 47:56.665
Yes.

47:57.541 --> 47:58.625
All right.

48:01.295 --> 48:03.672
It's been so long
since I last saw a vending machine.

48:10.178 --> 48:11.263
Wait.

48:19.646 --> 48:22.941
I knew it. It's Yeon-su again.

48:24.776 --> 48:27.487
Did everyone else
in this neighborhood disappear?

48:27.571 --> 48:28.947
Why is it always her?

48:38.040 --> 48:39.082
Have you been drinking?

48:50.469 --> 48:51.720
Just go home.

48:52.804 --> 48:55.265
Ten reasons why I hate Kook Yeon-su.

48:56.266 --> 48:58.310
Am I the easiest thing you have

48:59.061 --> 49:00.270
that you can throw away?

49:02.314 --> 49:03.315
No.

49:04.358 --> 49:05.901
You're the only thing

49:07.027 --> 49:08.236
I can throw away.

49:11.740 --> 49:12.991
Why are you doing this?

49:16.078 --> 49:17.454
What reason do you have?

49:18.580 --> 49:20.916
Why do we have to break up?

50:00.747 --> 50:02.374
The tenth and the last reason.

50:03.667 --> 50:08.755
She erased me from her life so quickly.

50:21.935 --> 50:23.770
Good morning.

50:23.854 --> 50:25.439
- Ms. Kook!
- You're here!

50:26.273 --> 50:28.066
You seem to be in a good mood.

50:28.150 --> 50:32.112
Of course. You gave us
an amazing present, Ms. Kook.

50:32.195 --> 50:33.905
- What present?
- Come on.

50:33.989 --> 50:36.283
Did you keep it under wraps
to surprise us?

50:37.117 --> 50:38.285
What do you mean?

50:38.368 --> 50:40.579
Someone from Go-oh's agency visited.

50:40.662 --> 50:43.248
We heard that you were friends with Go-oh.

50:43.331 --> 50:45.417
Why didn't you tell us?

50:45.500 --> 50:47.669
Wait. Who came?

50:47.753 --> 50:51.047
His manager came to say
he'll work on the Soen Shop project.

50:51.757 --> 50:54.009
Choi Ung, no wait.

50:54.092 --> 50:55.761
Go-oh said he'd do it?

50:55.844 --> 50:56.678
Yes.

50:56.762 --> 51:01.308
He said he'd do it because
you promised him to help with something.

51:01.975 --> 51:04.227
- Me?
- "Me?"

51:05.270 --> 51:07.397
Come on.

51:07.481 --> 51:09.691
Who knew you'd have such connections?

51:09.775 --> 51:12.861
I already told Soen Shop
this amazing news.

51:12.944 --> 51:15.697
No way. That's impossible.

51:16.406 --> 51:19.910
Excuse me for a moment.
I need to meet someone.

51:19.993 --> 51:21.369
I'll be out for a minute.

51:21.953 --> 51:22.871
What?

51:31.379 --> 51:33.590
Why did you send me
to get the contract so early?

51:33.673 --> 51:35.509
I thought it was about NJ.

51:36.551 --> 51:37.719
Did you do as I told you?

51:37.803 --> 51:38.887
Yes.

51:39.387 --> 51:40.931
Did you see Yeon-su?

51:41.014 --> 51:42.307
No, she wasn't there.

51:43.058 --> 51:43.975
Is that so?

51:45.894 --> 51:47.938
It's going to get noisy here soon.

51:48.522 --> 51:49.773
You'd better stay away.

51:50.607 --> 51:51.817
Why?

51:51.900 --> 51:53.944
It's going to get messy here soon.

51:55.612 --> 51:56.863
What?

51:56.947 --> 52:00.283
One, ten, hundred, thousand…
17 thousand likes?

52:01.159 --> 52:06.122
Why did 17,867 people like
my photo of us eating meat?

52:06.206 --> 52:07.624
What do you mean?

52:16.341 --> 52:18.009
What's wrong with you?

52:19.302 --> 52:20.178
NJ.

52:21.096 --> 52:23.682
NJ liked my photo!

52:23.765 --> 52:25.976
- What?
- Look.

52:26.059 --> 52:27.143
What?

52:28.186 --> 52:29.229
NJ!

52:31.523 --> 52:33.567
NJ liked my photo!

52:34.359 --> 52:36.278
NJ liked my photo!

52:40.991 --> 52:41.950
About Ung…

52:42.951 --> 52:44.452
I think it was when we were nine.

52:44.536 --> 52:46.913
I always teased him and ran away.

52:47.622 --> 52:48.623
What about it?

52:48.707 --> 52:51.084
I think he wanted to get back at me.

52:51.167 --> 52:54.170
One day, he brought
bingsu for us to share.

52:54.254 --> 52:55.922
So I gladly ate it.

52:56.006 --> 53:00.427
But it contained peaches.
I'm allergic to them.

53:00.510 --> 53:02.137
But he's allergic to them too.

53:02.220 --> 53:05.891
Right. That crazy bastard
ate peaches with me

53:05.974 --> 53:07.225
just to get revenge on me.

53:08.518 --> 53:10.770
Jeez. He really is nuts.

53:10.854 --> 53:13.940
We were both taken
to the emergency room with swollen faces,

53:14.524 --> 53:18.862
and he smirked at me
from the bed next to me.

53:19.446 --> 53:21.698
That's when I stopped bullying him.

53:22.574 --> 53:24.492
But why are you telling me this?

53:25.911 --> 53:29.915
Choi Ung is the kind of person
who isn't afraid to be in pain

53:29.998 --> 53:33.501
if he can make others suffer.

53:34.085 --> 53:37.130
And you'll soon find out what that means.

53:38.423 --> 53:42.636
No way. Would he really go that far?

53:45.180 --> 53:46.598
That's what I thought,

53:47.515 --> 53:50.018
but seeing his face made me realize it.

53:51.728 --> 53:52.979
He really is nuts.

53:54.648 --> 53:56.066
What do you mean?

53:56.816 --> 53:59.611
Don't tell me you agreed
to do our project just so that…

54:00.278 --> 54:02.447
Yes. Because you'll be helping me too.

54:04.074 --> 54:06.284
By helping you, do you mean…

54:06.368 --> 54:08.453
I want to film the documentary again.

54:08.536 --> 54:09.537
With you.

54:10.205 --> 54:14.584
This may not be different
from when I ate those peaches.

54:14.668 --> 54:15.961
That's my condition.

54:16.503 --> 54:19.005
Let's film that documentary together
for a month.

54:21.341 --> 54:22.509
Hey.

54:24.219 --> 54:25.303
Choi Ung!

54:26.763 --> 54:28.723
If Yeon-su hates it this much,

54:29.349 --> 54:30.558
then I can endure it.

54:38.316 --> 54:41.069
EPILOGUE

54:41.152 --> 54:42.237
This is so ridiculous.

54:42.821 --> 54:45.281
Does he still hate me that much?

54:46.408 --> 54:49.953
Well, as for me…

54:50.662 --> 54:51.913
I don't care.

54:52.956 --> 54:55.000
That's just how I am.

54:55.083 --> 54:57.585
I don't hold grudges against people.

54:57.669 --> 54:58.878
I mean it.

55:00.922 --> 55:03.633
FIVE YEARS AGO
AFTER THE BREAKUP

55:26.614 --> 55:28.450
- Enjoy.
- Thank you.

55:28.533 --> 55:29.743
You can leave that here.

55:29.826 --> 55:31.745
- Okay, thank you.
- Thank you.

55:34.289 --> 55:35.749
Welcome.

55:35.832 --> 55:37.500
- I want to make an order.
- Yes.

55:48.720 --> 55:50.513
If you have something to say,

55:50.597 --> 55:52.307
stop staring at me and just say it.

55:56.770 --> 55:58.354
Are you sure you're okay?

56:00.690 --> 56:01.524
What do you mean?

56:12.535 --> 56:14.037
You broke up with Ung.

56:15.246 --> 56:17.791
You dated for such a long time.

56:19.542 --> 56:22.587
Hey, you can be honest with me.

56:22.670 --> 56:25.340
Just tell me if you're in pain.

56:25.423 --> 56:28.802
It's scarier seeing you act
as if nothing's happened.

56:28.885 --> 56:30.386
It's making me uncomfortable.

56:30.470 --> 56:32.347
You sure have a lot to worry about.

56:34.390 --> 56:35.934
Are you really okay?

56:37.268 --> 56:38.186
Yes.

56:38.686 --> 56:40.063
I really am.

56:49.906 --> 56:51.699
Grandma, I'm home.

58:18.912 --> 58:20.371
I'm totally fine.

58:21.206 --> 58:22.290
I mean it.

58:25.376 --> 58:32.383
10 THINGS I HATE ABOUT YOU

58:57.784 --> 58:59.536
Don't make me laugh.

58:59.619 --> 59:01.246
Is that what he said?

59:01.329 --> 59:05.875
The minor details may be different but…

59:05.959 --> 59:09.254
It was that day
when everything started going haywire.

59:09.337 --> 59:10.588
Hey.

59:10.672 --> 59:13.967
- Since you're quite childish and pathetic…
- Hey.

59:15.969 --> 59:18.096
I believe you.

59:19.180 --> 59:20.932
You also ruined my life.

59:21.015 --> 59:22.517
You caused havoc.

59:25.019 --> 59:28.481
Subtitle translation by: Ju-young Park
